thub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99405.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-16T18:17:00Z"},"body":"Shortcuts for the first 4 devices in the list are available, but only the first one is bound by default to <kbd>Shift + F5</kbd>[^1] (<kbd>Cmd + Shift + B</kbd> on macOS).\r\n\r\nThis also renames \"Remote Debug\" tooltips to \"Remote Deploy\", as remote deploy doesn't always imply you'll have debugging enabled (**Deploy with Remote Debug** needs to be enabled in the Debug menu for that to happen).\r\n\r\n[^1]: This shortcut has an issue with having its focus stolen when the script editor is focused. This doesn't occur if you click outside the script editor before pressing the shortcut, or if in the 2D/3D editor. We should look into fixing this separately.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11143.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241118_202732](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c6ab6af-b4e2-4078-b224-dfd636758034)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99405/reactions